WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.920
A woman walks through the lonely hills in
the dead of night.

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:09.280
Her purple sari is torn and filthy from days
of exposure to the elements; her bare feet

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:12.640
have been cut up and bruised by the rough
terrain she walks.

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:17.440
But her clothes and her feet are not the most
noticeable thing about her: This woman is

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:20.800
pregnant, her belly swollen&nbsp;
to freakish proportions.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:24.160
It’s frankly a miracle that she’s even
able to walk in this state.

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:28.080
She stumbles and sways under the weight of
the thing growing inside her.

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:32.640
Whatever it is, it’s too large to be any
kind of ordinary baby.

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:37.440
But she keeps moving, muttering to herself
in a language that no human ear has heard

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:38.400
in years.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:41.360
Her eyes are glazed over, almost hypnotized.

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:46.000
She moves with great purpose, but her vacant
facial expression makes it appear as though

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.120
she doesn’t know exactly what that purpose
is.

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:54.800
She just needs to keep moving further into
the wilderness until “It” happens, whatever

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:55.760
“It” is.

00:00:55.760 --> 00:01:00.240
The one thing that’s certain is that It
isn’t anything good.

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:02.800
A car rumbles down a nearby dirt road.

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:07.680
It’s being driven by Dr. Vinay Ramachandran,
a medical practitioner from the nearby city

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:12.960
of Surat who occasionally drives out to more
rural areas, where the locals might not have

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:14.960
easy access to medical help.

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:19.040
He spots the staggering woman and immediately
pumps the breaks of his car.

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:23.520
She’s clearly in need of medical attention,
thank goodness he happened to be driving by

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:24.400
at the time!

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:29.440
Dr. Ramachandran grabs his medical bag from
the back seat and rushes towards the woman,

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:32.080
who collapses in a heap before he reaches
her.

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:37.120
That’s when, to his utter horror, Dr. Ramachandran
notices that the woman’s belly is continuing

00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:39.360
to swell at an unnatural rate.

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:44.000
Even for a woman who was heavily pregnant
with triplets, this would still be far too

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:44.720
large.

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:49.040
And the rate at which she’s swelling is
akin to someone blowing up a balloon.

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:53.040
By the time Dr. Ramachandran reaches her,
the worst has already happened.

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:58.160
The woman’s belly has burst open, and crouching
on her corpse is the thing that was growing

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:02.720
inside her: An adult man, nude and covered
in blood.

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:08.080
Dr. Ramachandran’s terror only increases
when he notices that the man is eating her.

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:10.880
Elsewhere, a riot is unfolding in the streets.

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:16.160
A megaphone-wielding instigator barks orders
for violence and chaos as the rioters spread,

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:21.600
setting fires, smashing windows, and attacking
any unfortunate civilians caught in their

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:22.240
way.

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:25.520
It’s one of the worst riots that the area
has ever seen.

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:28.960
Even the veteran riot cops are frightened
by the ferocity of it.

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:32.720
The cops descend and clash with the crowd
of ever-advancing rioters.

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:37.040
They’re beaten back with crowbars, baseball
bats, knives, and metal pipes.

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:42.640
And behind them all, the instigator continues
spitting his venomous words, working the crowd

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:44.720
into an unmatchable frenzy.

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:48.400
They’ll need heavy reinforcements if they
want to get this riot under control.

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:53.600
That’s when one of the riot cops on the
front line, Sergeant Abhishek, notices something

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:58.320
strange: So many of the rioters seem to have
the exact same face.

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:00.480
The face of the instigator.

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:06.000
Another place, another time, four men are
digging up a grave in a desolate old graveyard.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:09.600
They work tirelessly, all moving in perfect
synchronicity.

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:13.680
They’re only interrupted when a group of
heavily-armed men crash the party and start

00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:14.720
firing on them.

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:16.880
But these graverobbers are prepared.

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:22.080
All of them draw revolvers like a gang in
an old Western and begin returning fire, causing

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:26.000
the men in tactical gear to seek cover behind
the nearby tombstones.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:27.920
While one of the graverobbers continues to&nbsp;

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:31.040
fire, the other three&nbsp;
scatter during the confusion.

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:36.080
When his gun runs dry with that telltale click,
the men in tactical gear immediately rise

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:40.640
up and pincushion him with shot after shot
of their assault rifles.

00:03:40.640 --> 00:03:44.720
He does the bullet dance like Tony Montana
and collapses to the ground.

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:49.840
But when the gunmen approach to confirm the
kill, there’s a horrifying twist of fate:

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:55.200
Swarms of horrible red flies start pouring
out of every bullet wound, swarming the attackers,

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:58.800
who retreat, swatting away these horrible
little insects.

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:00.240
But there’s so many of them.

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:03.920
There’s no way to stop at least some of
them from crawling into their mouths.

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:09.200
Here’s an interesting fact: All of these
nightmarish incidences are connected.

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:15.520
In the year 1969, a mysterious man was arrested
in Himatnagar, an area in the Indian state

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:16.560
of Gujarat.

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:21.760
This man had been accused of inciting civil
unrest, terrorizing and distressing the local

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:22.400
people.

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:27.360
He was later extradited to an unknown location
after the Indian authorities received a request

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:33.040
from a mysterious organization known as - yep,
you guessed it - the SCP Foundation.

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:36.640
Who could this man have possibly been to attract
such attention?

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:40.320
The authorities thought it best not to question
it, they were probably just glad to be rid

00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:41.840
of the troublemaker once and for all.

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:45.120
Except they weren’t - Not by a long shot.

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:50.960
A few years later, in 1975, a group of four
men were discovered in a cemetery, this time

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:55.840
in Ahmedabad, another location in Gujarat,
India, for desecrating graves.

00:04:55.840 --> 00:05:00.400
This would be strange and upsetting enough,
but what really sent things to the next level

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:05.680
of weirdness was the discovery that these
four men were all the same man.

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:10.400
each one was not only genetically identical
to one another, but also to the man that had

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:13.440
been extradited in 1969.

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:17.600
You’d be more than justified in asking,
“What the hell is going on here?

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:20.640
Maybe they were a group of&nbsp;
highly rare quintuplets,&nbsp;

00:05:20.640 --> 00:05:23.120
five children all born from the same mother,

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:27.760
who just happened to have a predilection towards
crime and antisocial behavior.

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:32.640
Or perhaps something stranger was afoot: The
four who appeared in the cemetery might have

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:35.680
been clones of the original troublemaker in
Himatnagar.

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:40.720
As relatively simple as those explanations
would be, the truth was in fact far, far weirder

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:44.400
than mad science or coincidentally criminal
quintuplets.

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:49.040
The four from the cemetery had been ambushed
by operatives of the Global Occult Coalition,

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:53.120
another shadowy organization fans of this
channel are likely to recognize.

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:58.400
The Coalition, or “GOC”, is a group that
views itself as the police of the paranormal

00:05:58.400 --> 00:06:03.920
world, using extremely advanced technology
to destroy supernatural entities and artifacts

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:05.440
rather than contain them.

00:06:05.440 --> 00:06:10.240
They’ve been known to work both alongside
and against the SCP Foundation; both groups’

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:14.800
combined interest in four genetically identical
men in an Indian graveyard seems to suggest

00:06:14.800 --> 00:06:17.760
there was something supernatural about their
origin.

00:06:17.760 --> 00:06:22.080
One of the men had been killed by the GOC,
while the remaining three were taken into

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:24.320
custody by the SCP Foundation.

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:26.080
Gotta love the power of teamwork.

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:27.840
But who were these men?

00:06:27.840 --> 00:06:32.240
Where had they come from and why did they
share identical genes to the first man from

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:33.520
six years earlier?

00:06:33.520 --> 00:06:35.440
Could there have been even more of them?

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:39.520
Well, in the years following, the Foundation
has been able to determine that, yes, there

00:06:39.520 --> 00:06:42.000
are more of these genetically&nbsp;
identical individuals&nbsp;

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:42.720
out there.

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:49.040
Across the more rural states of India, like
Gujarat, Rajasthan, Himachal Pradesh, Haryana,

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:55.120
Punjab, Jammu, and Kashmir, there may be over
a thousand instances of the same person.

00:06:55.120 --> 00:06:59.280
Collectively, they are known as SCP-2833.

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:04.800
While their outward appearances can vary somewhat,
instances of SCP-2833 all share the exact

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:07.120
same genetic traits as each other.

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:11.760
Depending on the area they are located in,
these anomalous people can speak various languages

00:07:11.760 --> 00:07:18.960
and regional dialects including Hindi, English,
Gujarati, Dogri, Kashmiri, Punjabi, Urdu,

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:23.200
and even an outdated, unknown language that
doesn’t correspond with any known modern

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:25.040
dialect or language family.

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:30.560
Each SCP-2833 also possesses the ability to
manipulate the organic matter of their own

00:07:30.560 --> 00:07:31.200
body.

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:35.600
Now, we don’t mean that these men will stretch
themselves like Mr. Fantastic , or turn into

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:40.080
something out of John Carpenter’s The Thing
but they are able to use their bodies to create…

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:43.520
well, something.

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:52.000
SCP-2833 instances can produce a small anomalous
parasite, known as SCP-2833-A. These are often

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:56.560
released through any bodily orifice like the
mouth, nose, or ears, or through any cuts

00:07:56.560 --> 00:08:00.000
or open wounds suffered by an SCP-2833.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:05.280
In other words, if you shot and killed an
SCP-2388, perhaps in a cemetery under the

00:08:05.280 --> 00:08:10.240
orders of the Global Occult Coalition, then
these parasites would still be able to escape

00:08:10.240 --> 00:08:12.000
through the victim’s bullet wounds.

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:17.680
The only way to stop this from happening is
to incinerate the body of a deceased SCP-2833,

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:20.160
burning them until there is nothing left.

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:22.640
So, what exactly are these parasites?

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:26.880
Well, they’re tiny invertebrates, meaning
they’re a small, cold-blooded organism with

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:29.600
no spine that can live on land or in water.

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:34.640
They closely resemble Dipterans, which are
any order of insects that contain what we

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:36.080
know as flies.

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:41.760
Red in color and twenty millimeters in length,
SCP-2833-As are composed of a combination

00:08:41.760 --> 00:08:45.920
of muscle tissue, keratin - the protein that
your hair, skin, and fingernails are made

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:48.800
from - and traces of ash, strangely enough.

00:08:48.800 --> 00:08:53.200
They are also capable of flying with their
two wings and will use these to attempt to

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:55.360
enter the body of a suitable host.

00:08:55.360 --> 00:09:00.480
While this can be any vertebrate creature,
it seems they have a preference for humans.

00:09:00.480 --> 00:09:06.240
Once inside the host’s body, an SCP-2833-A
parasite will attach itself to their nervous

00:09:06.240 --> 00:09:06.960
system.

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:12.480
This then allows the SCP-2833 instance that
the parasite originated from to control the

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:17.760
body of the host, taking over their bodily
and motor functions, nervous system, and all

00:09:17.760 --> 00:09:19.440
of their sensory organs.

00:09:19.440 --> 00:09:25.760
From here, an SCP-2833 will then either subject
the target to vivid, inescapable hallucinations,

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:28.160
or manipulate the functions of their body.

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:34.640
The parasites also contain a miniature instance
of another SCP-2833, only about two millimeters

00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:35.200
long.

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:41.600
While these mini SCP-2833s are usually chemically
inactive, lying dormant and unable to move,

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:45.520
this changes if the parasite’s host is a
human female.

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:52.800
In these cases, the SCP-2833-A creature will
implant the miniature SCP-2833 within the

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:54.880
uterus of their female host.

00:09:54.880 --> 00:10:01.200
After this, the new SCP-2833 will begin to
rapidly grow, consuming any and all organic

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:02.640
matter that surrounds it.

00:10:02.640 --> 00:10:08.080
Once again, the SCP-2833 that the parasite
originated from is still able to manipulate

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:13.200
the female host’s body and will use this
control to make her leave her home and travel

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:15.440
away from any urban environment.

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:22.080
After a year, the new instance of SCP-2833
will be born in a truly horrific fashion.

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:27.360
Every time this happens, the female host is
unable to survive the process, dying as a

00:10:27.360 --> 00:10:30.720
result of being used as an incubator for the
parasites.

00:10:30.720 --> 00:10:36.000
The newly formed SCP-2833 will retain all
the memories of the previous instance that

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:37.440
released the parasite.

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:40.960
They are even able to speak fluently from
the moment they are born.

00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:43.680
But that isn’t the most horrific part.

00:10:43.680 --> 00:10:49.680
What happens next is that the newborn SCP-2833
will then devour the body of the female host

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:50.720
that carried it.

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:56.480
Sometimes, the host can die before an SCP-2833
is born, with the parasite keeping their body

00:10:56.480 --> 00:10:59.120
embalmed until the new instance emerges.

00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:04.640
But regardless, the “mother” of an SCP-2833
will always die during birth.

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:10.080
The SCP Foundation has conducted a number
of interviews with the instances of SCP-2833

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:12.080
that they have captured and detained.

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:20.160
The first, SCP-2833-1, the man causing civil
unrest in Himatnagar, 1969, referred to himself

00:11:20.160 --> 00:11:26.640
as ‘we’, implying that all of the SCP-2833
instances share the same consciousness, acting

00:11:26.640 --> 00:11:28.400
as a hive mind of sorts.

00:11:28.400 --> 00:11:34.320
One of the men from the cemetery, SCP-2833-4,
elaborated further on the nature of these

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:38.160
anomalous beings when asked how many other
instances existed:

00:11:38.160 --> 00:11:40.560
“We are in your cages.

00:11:40.560 --> 00:11:43.600
We are distant from the hordes of the ignorant.

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:46.560
We are grown like crops and livestock.

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:50.960
We are growing in numbers and faith, and we
will grow until the ascension of Samādhi…

00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:56.160
Samādhi is beyond sight… the buried will
rise.

00:11:56.160 --> 00:11:59.120
To be consumed is the doorway to rebirth.

00:11:59.120 --> 00:12:03.360
This is our cycle, waiting for Samādhi with
patience.

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:08.400
We shall dance the Tandava and consume the
world for its rebirth.”

00:12:08.400 --> 00:12:13.280
“Samādhi” is a word meaning a crypt,
usually the final resting place of a saint

00:12:13.280 --> 00:12:15.600
or someone of religious significance.

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:20.640
Additionally, the “Tandava” is an ancient
dance, that according to legends, was performed

00:12:20.640 --> 00:12:24.320
by the Hindu god Shiva
, who was believed to be the source of all

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:28.640
things, the cycle of creation, preservation,
and destruction.

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:33.520
So, these anomalous beings and their parasites
appeared to be awaiting the discovery of an

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:40.720
ancient burial site, where someone or something
was prophesied to rise, consume the world,

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:42.800
and then recreate it.

00:12:42.800 --> 00:12:47.200
Thinking this Samādhi might pose a threat,
the Foundation probed a later instance of

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:51.120
SCP-2833 for further&nbsp;
information on its significance.

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:55.520
“If you intend to seek Samādhi, your quest
is in vain.

00:12:55.520 --> 00:12:58.160
For we are the inheritor to Samādhi.

00:12:58.160 --> 00:12:59.200
Only we!”

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:06.560
SCP-2833-42 protested when asked about the
Samādhi by a Foundation researcher, one Doctor

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:08.000
Sanjay Sheel.

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:09.920
“Samādhi does not threaten.

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:14.800
It is we who were threatened, exiled when
the Colossi overran Samādhi.

00:13:14.800 --> 00:13:18.160
We are the remnants, but we are never defeated.”

00:13:18.160 --> 00:13:19.520
The instance went on.

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:23.920
“We are of glorious lineage, the chosen
stock of Karcist Vaski.

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:27.200
Only the strongest and most zealous may serve
his purpose.

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:32.320
To that end, we cut and consume ourselves
to persist and await for Samādhi.”

00:13:32.320 --> 00:13:39.680
When asked who exactly Karcist Vaski was,
SCP-2833-42 answered “We are.

00:13:39.680 --> 00:13:42.400
We are Karcist Vaski.”

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:48.320
That word, “Karcist”, has long been associated
with the religious cult of Sarkicism, another

00:13:48.320 --> 00:13:52.640
group of interest you’re likely to be familiar
with if you’re a fan of what we do here.

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:57.520
This group worships flesh and disease and
is seen as an apocalyptic threat by the SCP

00:13:57.520 --> 00:13:58.400
Foundation.

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:02.720
The Sarkicist religion was founded thousands
of years ago by an ancient elder being known

00:14:02.720 --> 00:14:08.400
as the Sorcerer-King of Adytum, also called
Grand Karcist Ion.

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:13.600
The goal of Sarkicism is to bring about a
new age of flesh, elevating humanity to the

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:19.840
form of gods and potentially terraforming
the entire Earth using SCP-610, The Flesh

00:14:19.840 --> 00:14:20.800
that Hates.

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:23.680
So, who or what was Karcist Vaski?

00:14:23.680 --> 00:14:29.760
What role did it have in the religion of Sarkicism
and how does it link to SCP-2833?

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:34.160
The Foundation has collected a number of documents
once belonging to a man named Sir William

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:35.440
Henry Sleeman.

00:14:35.440 --> 00:14:40.240
Sleeman was an administrator who worked in
India on behalf of the British East India

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:43.200
Company before his death in 1856.

00:14:43.200 --> 00:14:46.960
And it is in his documents that some of the
answers can be found.

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:51.440
According to Sir William, the poor of India
told him about a group of mystics, who were

00:14:51.440 --> 00:14:54.400
both revered and feared among the country’s
peasantry.

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:58.800
This group called themselves the Vātula,
and seemed to hold what Sleeman described

00:14:58.800 --> 00:15:02.240
as “an unusual fetish towards death and
decay”.

00:15:02.240 --> 00:15:04.880
Sounds an awful lot like the Sarkicists, doesn’t
it?

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:10.400
Sir William heard rumors that these Vātula
worshiped Shiva, but were never seen at temples,

00:15:10.400 --> 00:15:13.600
choosing instead to worship the Hindu god
in seclusion.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:18.640
Additionally, though, each member of the Vātula,
when asked, identified themselves by the title

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:20.640
of “Karcist Vaski.”

00:15:20.640 --> 00:15:24.800
Not everyone feared them, however, as a group
of men would often attack them.

00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:29.600
These men were Thuggee, organized gangs of
professional robbers and murderers that traveled

00:15:29.600 --> 00:15:33.200
India, strangling their victims to death and
robbing them blind.

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:37.680
Perhaps because of this, the Vātula seemed
wary to interact with any other worshippers

00:15:37.680 --> 00:15:41.600
of Shiva, often dismissing them as pretenders
to the faith.

00:15:41.600 --> 00:15:45.920
Hoping to appease and gain an audience with
the Vātula, Sir William’s allies unleashed

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:50.880
what they called the Daughter of Shadows,
better known as SCP-029.

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:55.280
This divided the Thuggee, in the hopes that
the Vātula would then accept Sleeman as an

00:15:55.280 --> 00:15:55.920
ally.

00:15:55.920 --> 00:16:00.560
Eventually, he achieved an audience with them
and was unable to determine whether this group

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:05.280
was genuinely devoted to their religious beliefs
or was just a group of madmen.

00:16:05.280 --> 00:16:09.920
What Sir William didn’t realize, was that
under the vestige of “Karcist Vaski”,

00:16:09.920 --> 00:16:14.480
this group was subtly spreading the influence
of Sarkicism over India.

00:16:14.480 --> 00:16:20.880
As for SCP-2833, perhaps they are the descendants
of the Vātula group, their lineage continuing

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:23.440
through the passing of those little parasites.

00:16:23.440 --> 00:16:29.760
It’s highly likely that these Vātula were
all early instances of SCP-2833, which would

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:35.840
explain why those captured by the SCP Foundation
claim that they are all Karcist Vaski.

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:41.200
A few years back in 2014, one of the Foundation’s
Mobile Task Forces uncovered a body that was

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:45.440
a genetic match to the other instances of
SCP-2833.

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:49.840
However, this one wasn’t found in India,
but in Krasnoyarsk Krai, Russia.

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:56.880
It had strange growths on its muscle tissue
and bones, carrying multiple SCP-2833-A parasites

00:16:56.880 --> 00:16:58.800
inside its internal organs.

00:16:58.800 --> 00:17:04.080
The body had even been modified to contain
an artificial uterus, which carried an infant

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:06.800
SCP-2833 instance.

00:17:06.800 --> 00:17:13.200
It seems that not only have SCP-2833 found
a new way to evolve, carrying themselves in

00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:17.680
a modified body, but they’re also beginning
to spread further than ever before.

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:21.920
You’ve gotta hand it to the Sarkicists - They’re
certainly adaptable.

00:17:21.920 --> 00:17:28.240
Now go check out “SCP-3989 - The Bone Orchard”
and “SCP-610 - The Flesh That Hates” for

00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:30.720
more scary Sarkicist SCPs!

